message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Neuroflux: Continual Deep Q-Learning for Sequential Channel Access in a Synthetic Cognitive-Radio Network"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sharma"
    given-names: "Manu"
abstract: >-
  Research code for sequential channel access in a synthetic cognitive-radio
  environment using a DQN, replay, elastic weight consolidation, TD-error
  change monitoring, and alarm-triggered rollback.
keywords:
  - cognitive radio
  - dynamic spectrum access
  - continual reinforcement learning
  - deep Q-network
